---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About the Studio" description="About ModelPath — Independent software studio philosophy and design approach.">
  <article>
    <h1 style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">About ModelPath</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      ModelPath is an independent studio focused on crafting focused, high-utility digital products.
    </p>
    <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Our Philosophy</h2>
    <ul style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 1.5rem;">
      <li><strong>Simplicity:</strong> Removing noise to emphasize core utility.</li>
      <li><strong>Usability:</strong> High ergonomics, accessible contrast, and tactile feedback.</li>
      <li><strong>Privacy:</strong> On-device processing whenever technically possible.</li>
      <li><strong>Performance:</strong> Lightweight, fast-loading, zero unnecessary bloat.</li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
